  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this board proves",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "This is the substrate view for Spot and Kubernetes disruption. **A real Spot preemption is only confirmed by the Cloud Audit Log metric below** (`compute.instances.preempted`). Kubernetes events are correlated observations; `FailedScheduling: preemption` is scheduler fit logic, not Spot proof.\n\nThe controller emits `octogee.disruption.v1` JSON records with node UID, provider/instance ID, capacity class, taints, gateway identity, assignment roster, and active Cowboy operations.\n\nThe audit metric knows **which instance** was preempted but not which gateway was on it. Cowboy records each gateway pod's instance id while the node still exists and emits `octogee.gateway-pod-replacement.v1` when that pod disappears with no desired-state change, so `instance_id` joins the two. Pod `RESTARTS` stays 0 through a preemption and Kubernetes events expire in ~1h \u2014 pod age is only a point-in-time hint.\n\n[Authoritative Spot Audit Logs](https://console.cloud.google.com/logs/query?project=octogee&query=resource.type%3D%22gce_instance%22%0Alog_id%28%22cloudaudit.googleapis.com%2Fsystem_event%22%29%0AprotoPayload.methodName%3D%22compute.instances.preempted%22) \u00b7 [Kubernetes NodeShutdown events](https://console.cloud.google.com/logs/query?project=octogee&query=log_id%28%22events%22%29%0AjsonPayload.reason%3D%22NodeShutdown%22) \u00b7 [Preemption \u2194 gateway correlation](https://console.cloud.google.com/logs/query?project=octogee&query=%28log_id%28%22cloudaudit.googleapis.com%2Fsystem_event%22%29%20AND%20protoPayload.methodName%3D%22compute.instances.preempted%22%29%20OR%20jsonPayload.schema%3D%22octogee.gateway-pod-replacement.v1%22)"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Current placement",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Spot nodes",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(glm_disruption_nodes{namespace=\"$namespace\",capacity_class=\"spot\"}) or count(kube_node_labels{job=\"gmp-kube-state-metrics\",label_cloud_google_com_gke_spot=\"true\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
