    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Action guide",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "- `compute.instances.preempted` + a node/pod event: **confirmed Spot preemption**.\n- Same `instance_id` in `octogee_gateway_pod_replacements` and `octogee_spot_preemptions`: **confirmed Spot preemption of that named gateway**.\n- An unplanned pod loss with no matching audit record is a node repair, an eviction, or an OOM-kill \u2014 the counter proves the loss, not the cause.\n- `NodeShutdown` without the audit event yet: **unconfirmed shutdown**, wait for the audit record.\n- `Killing` / `FailedPreStopHook`: termination behavior, not root cause.\n- `FailedScheduling` with `preemption: No preemption victims found`: scheduler capacity/fit, not Spot.\n- Shared Barn members are intentionally on-demand; Spot evidence should name only disposable builder gateways."
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 75
      }
